    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.bB0eDKVFcxQW4C2d]{Profile: Solène Marchetti}</p><blockquote><p><em>“I don&#39;t judge. I record. Time does the judging, and time always reads my books.”</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Epithet</th><td>She Who Takes Notes</td></tr><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Keeper of Elysium and Toreador Primogen</td></tr><tr><th>Clan</th><td>Toreador</td></tr><tr><th>Sect</th><td>Camarilla</td></tr><tr><th>Sire</th><td>A Toreador from Montreal, since destroyed</td></tr><tr><th>Born</th><td>1884</td></tr><tr><th>Embraced</th><td>1912</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>For Seattle&#39;s record to reach the twenty-second century intact.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Looks about twenty-eight. Tall, dark hair in a low bun, old-fashioned dresses in grays, and glasses on a chain; she writes with a fountain pen.</p>",
